  "defensiveAbilities": [
    {
      "name": "Head Bowl",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The depression atop a kappa's head is filled with water. Spilling, evaporating, or otherwise removing all of the water from the top of a kappa's head reduces all their Speeds to 5 feet until the basin is again filled with water.</p>\n<p>A kappa who becomes Prone must succeed at a DC 15 Reflex Saving Throw save or spill their water, and a kappa who becomes unconscious automatically spills their water.</p>\n<p>If a kappa is Grappled, Restrained, or Stunned, another creature can attempt to spill the water from their bowl by spending a single action, which has the attack and manipulate traits, to attempt an Athletics check against the kappa's Fortitude DC. On a success, the creature spills the kappa's water.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
  ],
